# The Rocket Hideout (FireRed's MUS_ROCKET_HIDEOUT, which Cerulean Cave shares later): a creeping, driving tune in D
# minor for Team Rocket's base under the Game Corner, a pulse lead in short, sharp figures over a pumping synth bass
# and low strings. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K5).
